    "raw_output": "```typescript\nexport function boundedPrefixSum(values: readonly bigint[], bound: bigint): bigint | null {\n  if (bound < 0n) {\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  let currentSum = 0n;\n  for (const value of values) {\n    currentSum += value;\n    if (currentSum > bound || currentSum < -bound) {\n      return null;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return currentSum;\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
